@startuml
start
- Open "Users" panel
- Select "Manage Access"
- Select a user
if (Is the user's admin tier modified?) then (yes)
else (no)
switch(Choose object type)
case(compute group)
  :Show compute groups;
case(container)
  :Show containers;
case(storage group)
  :Show storage groups;
endswitch
if(Is an object instance selected?) then (yes)
fork
  :Change
object visibility;
fork again
  :Change permission
to use object;
fork again
  :Change permission
to modify object;
fork again
  :Change permission
to delete object;
end fork
else (no)
:Change object creation permissions;
endif
endif
- Confirm changes
stop
@enduml